\f0\fs24 {\b Amendment No. 1 to Order Form: Halcyon Freight Lines}\par
\par
{\b 1. Parties and effect}\par
This Amendment No. 1 is made on 12 October 2026 between Kestrel Ridge and Halcyon Freight Lines. It amends the Order Form signed on 12 October 2026. Where this Amendment and the Order Form disagree, this Amendment governs.\par
\par
{\b 2. Additional units}\par
Halcyon adds 220 power units from its acquisition of Brightwater Haulage, taking the total to 860. Annual contract value rises from 240,000 USD to 318,000 USD from the contract start date of 15 October 2026.\par
\par
{\b 3. Second data source deadline}\par
Kestrel Ridge will connect the Brightwater Haulage fleet, which runs on Geotab telematics, within 21 days of the contract start date. If the Geotab connection is not live by 5 November 2026, Halcyon may withhold 10 percent of the first annual invoice until it is.\par
\par
{\b 4. Refund window}\par
The parties agree that the refund window under Section 8.2 of the Master Services Agreement is 45 days from the contract start date, ending 29 November 2026.\par
\par
{\b 5. Revised invoice}\par
Kestrel Ridge will issue a revised first invoice for 318,000 USD by 20 October 2026. Payment remains annual in advance, net 30.\par
}

